      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The Carrot is&nbsp;a versatile root vegetable known for its sweet and earthy flavor, satisfying crunch when raw, and tender texture when cooked. It is a staple in both savory and sweet dishes, appearing in everything from salads and soups to baked goods like carrot cake. Carrots can be prepared in numerous ways, including raw, roasted, boiled, mashed, or juiced, and are a key component in classic cooking bases like mirepoix.&nbsp;</span></p>",
